OL,3,GNEWSAFestival ferry link cancelled
OL,4,Aafter fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA passenger ferry service between
OL,7,FPortsmouth and the Isle of Wight has
OL,8,Fbeen suspended after a problem with the
OL,9,Fvessel's exhaust was found.
OL,11,FWightlink said the FastCat between
OL,12,FPortsmouth Harbour and Ryde Pier Head
OL,13,Fwould be out of action for the rest of
OL,14,Fthe day on Sunday. The ferry is used by
OL,15,Fpeople travelling from the Isle of
OL,16,FWight to the Victorious Festival on
OL,17,FSouthsea Common.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
