OL,3,GNEWSAFestival ferry link cancelled
OL,4,Aafter fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ferry firm said the hovercraft
OL,7,Fbetween Ryde and Southsea would run
OL,8,Fextra crossings, with Wightlink tickets
OL,9,Fbeing accepted. Passengers can also use
OL,10,Fthe Portsmouth-Fishbourne car ferry.
OL,12,FOn Saturday, several hovercraft
OL,13,Fcrossings between Ryde and Southsea
OL,14,Fwere cancelled following a technical
OL,15,Fissue and bad weather.
